# Generated files are compared byte-for-byte in CI. Without this, a Windows
# checkout would rewrite LF as CRLF and the site build would always look stale.
# 生成文件在 CI 中按字节比对；若不固定 LF，Windows 检出后会被改成 CRLF，
# 导致站点校验永远失败。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.sig binary